\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. In the Cross of Christ I glory:
\par Towering o'er the wrecks of time,
\par All the light of sacred story
\par Gathers round its head sublime.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When the woes of life o'ertake me,
\par Hopes deceive, and fears annoy,
\par Never shall the Cross forsake me:
\par Lo! it glows with peace and joy.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When the sun of bliss is beaming
\par Light and love upon my way:
\par From the Cross the radiance streaming
\par Adds more lustre to the day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Bane and blessing, pain and pleasure,
\par By the Cross are sanctified;
\par Peace is there that knows no measure,
\par Joys that through all time abide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. In the Cross of Christ I glory:
\par Towering o'er the wrecks of time,
\par All the light of sacred story
\par Gathers round its head sublime.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

